==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start by spamming meatshields, [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]]. When you will find a good opportunity, upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] and then spawn [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]]. When you have enough money, deploy a [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] to speed things up, and spawn [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] for extra support. When the groups of Gories appear, your stacks should easily overcome them.

