==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Mie Prefecture'''.
*The bull on Mie Prefecture's base is a reference to [[wikipedia:Matsusaka beef|Matsusaka beef]], the meat of cattle raised in the city of Matsusaka in Mie.

